      "writtenOn": "2024-09-12T00:03:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The name\u0027s a little misleading if I\u0027ve understood \"code\" correctly, since for a map of one function the list will have two elements, unless holes are allowed, in which case a map of one function could potentially have 16777215 elements.\n\nIf that\u0027s correct, maybe just go with the simpler name `length` and have the docs be \"length of the `transactionCodeToFunctionMap` in number of elements\"?\n\nI\u0027m not sure I\u0027ve understood this though, so maybe that\u0027s terrible advice 😊",
